  "prefLabel": "Env-Wq 1801.01 Purpose",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Env-Wq 1801.01 Purpose. The purpose of these rules is to explain:\n\n(a) The process for nominating a perennial river or river segment for protection under RSA 483; and\n\n(b) The criteria to be used to evaluate such nominations.\n\nSource. (See Revision Note at chapter heading for Env-Wq 1800) #8326, eff 4-21-05; ss by #9330, eff 11-26-08; ss by #12185, eff 5-25-17",
